   = note: storage fields hold handles, not values: wrap plain data in `Value<u64>`
   = note: the handle types are `Value`, `NNInt`, `Balance`, `Bytestring`, `Map`, `Vector`, `RCQ`, `CapacityConstraint`, and `Node` for a nested `#[storage]` struct
